Package: com.galaxys21tech.overlap
Name: Overlap
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Lets app open and close animations play at the same time. When you tap another app while the closing animation is still playing, it no longer gets cut off — both animations run together.
Maintainer: galaxys21tech
Author: galaxys21tech
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit (>= 0.4), firmware (>= 15.0)
